    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "746a70e1a9f87afc",
      "translationZh": "添加了 Claude Sonnet 5.5 ( claude-sonnet-5-5 ), 现在成为 Anthropic API 上的默认 Sonnet 模型 — — 1M 上下文，每 Mtok 2/10，缓存读取费用为 0.20/Mtok",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce4375e6fd0aadf5",
      "translationZh": "添加了一个 \"Yes, but ask again next time\" 的回答到 auto mode 的提示中，在读取工作目录以外的内容之前出现，这样您可以允许这一次读取，同时仍会在以后的读取时被询问",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48a41a30f7bcf776",
      "translationZh": "在 /usage 和状态行中为 Claude apps gateway 的花费限额添加了美元金额（例如 \"271.40 / 500.00 spent this month\"），当网关运行此版本或更高版本时生效；状态行的 rate_limits.spend_limit 还新增了 used_usd 、 limit_usd 和 period",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28a41e743042a00d",
      "translationZh": "添加了 effortSlider:decreaseEffort 、 increaseEffort 和 toggleUltracode 的键绑定操作，这样 /effort 滑块的箭头键和 Tab 键可以在 keybindings.json 中重新绑定",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78aa8179143e2dba",
      "translationZh": "添加了 /rate-limit-options 到 /help 和 claude.ai 订阅者的命令菜单中，这样提及它的使用限制通知会指向您可以找到的命令",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26c26ecdd034e4e0",
      "translationZh": "添加了 /mcp reconnect all 到交互式终端中，以一次性重试所有连接失败或需要身份验证的 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba137af6d5e2c58d",
      "translationZh": "添加了 Claude apps gateway 启动警告，当托管策略的 availableModels 为空，或遗漏了 Claude Code 启动时使用的模型且未设置 model 或 enforceAvailableModels 时触发",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e316d349486dce76",
      "translationZh": "添加了 auth: google: 到 Claude apps gateway 的 telemetry.forward_to 目标，这样可以使用网关的 Google Cloud 凭据将遥测数据直接导出到 Google Cloud 的 OTLP 端点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "213ea805e55646c7",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude 应用网关及其身份提供者之间添加了证书客户端身份验证（ private_key_jwt ），以支持使用证书凭据而非客户端密钥的身份提供者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14e91dac3be96b19",
      "translationZh": "修复了损坏的响应流，原本会显示诸如 \"JSON Parse error\" 或 \"undefined is not an object\" 之类的原始错误，或将 \"undefined\" 一词写入答案，而未进行重试或报告为中断响应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f13e23c0b4d29a4",
      "translationZh": "修复了在思考块结束回合并出现错误后立即到达的过载或服务器错误，未进行重试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5fa09a911b32b88",
      "translationZh": "修复了在压缩后仍然存在的 \"Prompt is too long\" 错误：当压缩后的请求仍然过长时，Claude Code 会再次压缩，保留较少的最近对话内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d244cccf94f1887",
      "translationZh": "修复了模型不可用且没有剩余后备模型的会话，原本会显示裸露的 \"is currently unavailable\" 消息（或云会话中的 \"Something went wrong\"），而未显示模型不可用通知及其 \"Learn more\" 链接。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fe993e062727474",
      "translationZh": "修复了当用户消息包含源格式错误的图像时 Agent SDK 会话崩溃的问题，以及在损坏的文档块之后每个后续回合都会失败；现在会用说明性注释替换格式错误的图像。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35f9264822a71db4",
      "translationZh": "修复了在恢复的会话中 MCP 工具调用因服务器仍在连接而失败并显示 \"No such tool available\" 的问题；现在调用会最多等待 10 秒以等待服务器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d3330f330d47dea",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 plan-usage 端点因速率限制或拒绝登录而重复调用的问题：/usage 、 /extra-usage 以及 IDE 使用视图现在会退避而不是重新请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d1b853a9b01b1b9",
      "translationZh": "修复了在受管理的设置将 MCP 服务器限制为仅插件时，claude mcp 添加会错误地报告成功；现在它会拒绝并说明应如何操作，而不是保存一个永远不会加载的服务器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
